# Pure SaaS Windsurf Rules
# Universal UI/UX Design System & Anti-Slop Discipline

When modifying or generating frontend components, styling, or layouts:
1. Always maintain and reference DESIGN.md for semantic colors, typography hierarchy, and spacing tokens.
2. Anti-Slop Enforcement:
   - Prohibit unapproved purple/cyan gradient backgrounds and text.
   - Prohibit excessive glassmorphism and blurry backdrops.
   - Avoid monotonous three-column card grids; use asymmetrical and editorial layouts.
   - Use clean SVG icons (Lucide, Heroicons), never emojis.
3. Accessible Craft:
   - Target WCAG 2.2 AA contrast.
   - Enforce visible keyboard focus indicators on all interactive elements.
   - Add prefers-reduced-motion queries for all animations.
4. Validation:
   - Run node scripts/pure-saas.mjs validate DESIGN.md to ensure structural integrity.
